claim.claim-text:
receiving, at one or more input components of one or more client devices, a vocal utterance from a user;
applying data indicative of the vocal utterance across a trained machine learning model to generate output;
determine, based on the output, that the user falls into a predetermined age group;
selecting, based on the predetermined age group, a mode associated with a grammatical tolerance;
determining an intent of the user using a given query understanding model;
determining, based on mode, that the intent of the user is resolvable;
resolving the user's intent to generate responsive data; and
outputting, at one or more output components of one or more of the client devices, the responsive data.

receiving, at one or more input components of one or more client devices, a vocal utterance from a user;
performing voice recognition to determine an identity of the user;
consulting a profile associated with the identity to determine that the user falls into a predetermined age group;
selecting, based on the predetermined age group, a mode associated with a grammatical tolerance;
determining an intent of the user using a given query understanding model;
determining, based on the mode, that the intent of the user is resolvable;
resolving the user's intent to generate responsive data; and
outputting, at one or more output components of one or more of the client devices, the responsive data.
